      "text": "Long video, but it has missed out the roots of the problem.\n\nVenezuela is a living example of how Socialism ruins a country.\n\nHugo Chavez - President - adopted Socialism. People got everything from the State without having to work. Soon their manufacturing and industries died - they Imported everything - and the country could afford - thanks to oil. Maduro - the successor - continued with same policies. In less than a generation's time span Venezuela became a nation of zombies - no industries, no people working on farms, and skills were lost. Corruption was rampant. When the time was adverse and demanded people to stand up for themselves - they were not able to. They were too much dependent on the welfare State. Mind-sets once become used to getting things for free, are very difficult to change.\nReally sad state of affairs.\n\nWelfare State - though sounds and feels good - has its own consequences, if it is over-done. Even if the country has enormous mineral wealth.\n\nAnd then there is Trump to snatch away whatever hopes they might still be left with.",
